{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act48side_level_act48side_06_end","storyGroup":"act48side","storySort":14,"storyDependence":"act48side_level_act48side_06_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"ME-6","storyName":"旧日诗篇","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"失去挚友的恨意在赞索斯心中涌动，无处排遣。老人揭露了一段尘封的往事，让赞索斯发现了帕夏派遣使节团前来交换文物的真正目的。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act48side/level_act48side_06_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act48side_06","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":11,"next":13,"characters":["忧心的村民","赞索斯","游击队员A","游击队员B","游击队员C","游击队员D","萨尔贡军官","伊萨科斯父亲","吕刻伊昂"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_y.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blackmask","layer":"1","id":5},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_oldtv","layer":"2","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧心的村民","text":"你真决定要离开村子啦？","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"明天天一亮就动身。","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#8$2","focus":"r","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"田地都已经重新耕过一遍，种子和存粮足够，仓库也都修过，摆渡的技术，我也教给了那几个年轻人，别担心。","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧心的村民","text":"我是担心你啊，赞索斯。","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧心的村民","text":"你从来没离开过这片沼地，现在跑那么远的路，就为了找一个外乡人？","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2","focus":"r","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"伊萨科斯是我的兄弟，他也帮助过我们所有人。","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧心的村民","text":"一年过去了，或许他已经回雅赛努斯了......毕竟，那才是他的故乡。","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#13$2","focus":"r","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"他答应过的事，都会做到。","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"他答应过我，打完了仗，便会回来。","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧心的村民","text":"那你有没有想过，如果，如果他已经......","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧心的村民","text":"他去的地方，可是和萨尔贡人的战场......","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#12$2","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"那我就替他报仇，替米诺斯人报仇。","id":35},{"type":"dialog","id":36},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":37},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":38},{"type":"charslot","id":39},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":40},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_bg_bg_wild_m.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":41},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":43},{"type":"animtext","id":44,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_heavy","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>米诺斯，北部山地</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":45},{"type":"animtextclean","id":46},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#2$1","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"150,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2084_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":50},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":51},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":52},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2084_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员A","text":"你别激动！你认错人了！我真的不是什么伊萨科斯！","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"激动的是你，同胞。我只是认出了你身上的这块护甲。","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2084_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员A","text":"......","id":60},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":62},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"它属于伊萨科斯，我的弟弟。临行前，村里每家每户都送来了兽皮和铁器，我亲手为他缝制了勉强像样的全身甲胄，打造了武器。","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2084_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员A","text":"抱、抱歉，一直在打仗，大大小小的仗，我已经很久没睡过好觉了，精神有些......","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"给你，壶里还有一些宁神的草茶。","id":69},{"type":"dialog","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2084_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":71},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","channel":"1","id":72},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","channel":"2","delay":"1","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"请告诉我，你从谁那里得到的这块护甲？","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2084_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员A","text":"另一个游击队的战友。我们在一场遭遇战中相遇......他中了箭，咽气前，给了我......","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2084_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员A","text":"但他不叫伊萨科斯。","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1","focus":"l","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"呼......","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2084_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员A","text":"你看这护甲上面的痕迹，斑驳成这样，明显已经经手过很多人......","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员A","text":"你或许不了解，游击队不比萨尔贡人的正规军，我们的物资非常有限。","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员A","text":"大家往往会将武器、防具和粮食集中起来，再按照任务的优先级统一调配。","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员A","text":"我可以告诉你那个战友所在游击队的番号，指给你他们现在所在的方位......啊，我得先把这块护甲还给你。","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"留着吧，你还用得着。同胞，指给我方向就好。","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2084_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员A","text":"可以是可以，但你真要进山找吗？","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员A","text":"这一整片山地都是游击队活跃的地方，是我们和萨尔贡人的战场......","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"那我申请加入游击队。","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2084_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员A","text":"你上过战场吗？","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"（摇头）在这之前，我的手只握过船桨和农具。","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1","focus":"l","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"但我们别无选择，不是吗？","id":102},{"type":"dialog","id":103},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":104},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"charslot","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":107},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_bg_bg_wild_a.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2083_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-40,0","duration":"0","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","id":110},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":111},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2083_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员B","text":"抱歉，你说的那个爱笑的长发丰蹄，我没有太多印象。","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员B","text":"至于这双靴子，是我刚加入游击队时领到的......按照当时送物资过来的战友的说法，它属于一个左边角缺了一块的中年大叔。","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"它破了。","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2083_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员B","text":"对、对不起。它对我来说有点小了，我还没来得及补。","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员B","text":"那帮萨尔贡人一直撵在我们后面，要不是你及时赶到支援......","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"坐下来。","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2083_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员B","text":"啊？","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我帮你补。","id":128},{"type":"dialog","id":129},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":130},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.2","id":131},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":132},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_putontable_large","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":134},{"type":"dialog","id":135},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":137},{"type":"charslot","id":138},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tapemeasure","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":140},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_bg_bg_wild_a.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2083_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-40,0","duration":"0","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","id":143},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":144},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2083_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员B","text":"谢谢你......啊，你的手虽然大，但是好灵巧啊......你加入游击队多久了？","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"四个多月......最开始是为了找人。","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#13$2","focus":"r","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"这双靴子，你留着吧。","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2","focus":"r","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"战斗、转移、蛰伏、整顿。流血，死去或者擦干再投入下一场战斗......这样的日子，还有很长。","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2083_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员B","text":"......","id":156},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2","focus":"r","id":158},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":159},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#10$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1","focus":"r,m","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"送来这双靴子的战友来自哪里？同胞，指给我方向就好。","id":164},{"type":"dialog","id":165},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"charslot","id":168},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":169},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_bg_bg_outcounty.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2071_1#1$2","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":173},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2071_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员C","text":"......","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员C","text":"我就说这面盾角落的字符肯定有什么含义......原来是“伊萨科斯”名字的缩写，你刻的？","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"（点头）","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2071_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员C","text":"所以，这大半年，你一直辗转在各个战场，几乎在每一个游击队都待过，就是为了找人？","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"看来，你也没法告诉我更多。","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2071_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员C","text":"抱歉，赞索斯。而且，我不打算把这面盾还给你。","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员C","text":"你看看，这上面的刀痕有多少！还有这些黑印......萨尔贡人的法术都没轰碎它！","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员C","text":"我得留着它，这样才能保护更多战友，或者让我活到能回家的那天。","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"那样的话，就再好不过了。","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"就让“伊萨科斯”的名字与你同在，就让我们的血与眼，见证我们的胜。","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2071_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员C","text":"那就在此分别吧，我的战友。","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"同胞，指给我方向就好。","id":197},{"type":"dialog","id":198},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":199},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":200},{"type":"charslot","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":202},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_bg_bg_cave_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":206},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"你可以试着换个方向。伊萨科斯是左撇子，所以当时陪他打造这个施术单元的时候，我刻意做过设计。","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员D","text":"难怪呢，我就说怎么功率不对劲！","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员D","text":"......赞索斯，这么说起来，已经一年多了啊。","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1","focus":"r","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"真快啊，时间就像化冻后的河流。","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员D","text":"你已经成为这片山地里最有名的游击队员，你打过最多的仗，去过最多的战场，大家无不赞叹你的英勇......","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员D","text":"但你的弟弟，你真的还要一直找下去吗？","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我没有停下来的理由。","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"就像，你也不会转身离开这片战场。","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员D","text":"嗐，说得也是。","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"听你的口音，你来自拉刻代蒙？","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员D","text":"算是吧。具体来讲，我的家乡在那座移动城市的航道边上，是个河谷，春天的时候很好看。","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我刚刚跟你讲过了我的家乡，我和伊萨科斯共同建起来的那座小村子，你也跟我讲讲你的家乡吧。","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我们已经输了一百多年，我们都不确定这场战争的结局，我们应该铭记彼此的家乡......我们应该铭记彼此。","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"游击队员D","text":"乐意之至，我的同胞。","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"明天，我将继续启程寻找。同胞，指给我方向就好。","id":237},{"type":"dialog","id":238},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":241},{"type":"charslot","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":243},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_bg_bg_forest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_164","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":247},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":248},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":249},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_164","focus":"l","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡军官","text":"米诺斯人，为什么要将我绑在树上羞辱？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_164.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我说过，回答我的问题。","id":254},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_164","focus":"l","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡军官","text":"伊萨科斯伊萨科斯，又是伊萨科斯！","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_164.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡军官","text":"*萨尔贡粗口*，好了，我受不了了......两年前，在这附近，我带领的队伍确实和一支护送伤员的米诺斯游击队遭遇过。","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_164.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡军官","text":"我记得他们的旗帜，和你刚刚说的番号对得上。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_164.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡军官","text":"我们全歼了那支游击队。你说的那什么伊萨科斯，应该就在那群人里。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_164.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡军官","text":"你满意了吗？你们专门布置了这场伏击，就是为了两年前的那场战斗，就是为了抓我这一个人报仇？","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_164.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡军官","text":"疯子，米诺斯人，你真是个疯子！","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_164.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"说来你或许不相信，这只是一个巧合。","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#16$1","focus":"r","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"今天之前，我并没有想过会找到伊萨科斯，或者杀害了他的敌人。","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"这场战斗，和这一年多来，不，和这一百多年来发生的每一场战斗，并没有什么不同。","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"萨尔贡人，你们侵占了别人的土地，而我们，不得不保卫自己的家园。","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我只是习惯了逢人便问：“请问你见过伊萨科斯吗？你见过那个爱笑的长发丰蹄吗？他从雅赛努斯来，但有一些南方乡下的口音。”","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"这么看来，我真是你所说的，“疯子”。","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_164","focus":"l","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡军官","text":"......","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_164.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#15$1","focus":"r","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我找到了他的护甲、他的靴子、他的盾、他的施术单元......我找到了他留在这片山林里的一切。","id":274},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我找到了他。","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我当然不指望你这样的贼寇能记清每个米诺斯人的名字，你们的帕夏也并不在意功劳册上的每一笔具体对应着什么，对吧？","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"那么......“伊萨科斯”，你就记住这一个名字。","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"它是我们的情与爱，也是你们的罪与罚。","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_164","focus":"l","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡军官","text":"......","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_164.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":285},{"type":"multiline","name":"赞索斯","text":"现在，告诉我，","id":286},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.4","xstrength":"60","ystrength":"60","vibrato":"70","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":288},{"type":"multiline","name":"赞索斯","text":"那场战斗具体发生在什么位置？！","id":289},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"80","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":290},{"type":"multiline","name":"赞索斯","text":"那些米诺斯人，他们的血具体流进了哪一棵枞树下？！","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_164","focus":"l","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡军官","text":"......","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_164.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":294},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_breezetree","volume":"1","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":297},{"type":"charslot","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":299},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":300,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":301},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":302},{"type":"subtitle","text":"赞索斯抬眼望去，成百上千棵米诺斯枞树傲然挺立着身躯。风吹来，整片树林扑簌作响。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":303},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这片土地，这些林木，它们记得很多事，但它们不会言说。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":304},{"type":"subtitle","text":"他的弟弟，他的挚友，循着神谕离开家乡的年轻人，死在其中的某一处——每一处。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":305},{"type":"subtitle","text":"伊萨科斯，无数的伊萨科斯，为了保护脚下的这片土地，尸骨无存。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":306},{"type":"subtitle","text":"赞索斯抬起了手中的巨桨——一年多了，它已经遗忘了河流的声响，能够湿润它的，唯有仇人的血！","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":307},{"type":"subtitle","id":308},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"——！","id":312},{"type":"dialog","id":313},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":314},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_twohandedblunt","volume":"1","id":315},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":317},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":319},{"type":"dialog","id":320},{"type":"charslot","id":321},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":322},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_bg_58_g14_yanprison.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":323},{"type":"bgeffect","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#15$2","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#4$1","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":327},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":328},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":329},{"type":"charslot","id":330},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"你替伊萨科斯报了仇？","id":332},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#15$2","focus":"l","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"没有。","id":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"在我抬起手中的武器即将砸向那个萨尔贡人头颅的瞬间，同胞制止了我的动作，与此同时，号角响了。","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"您从来没告诉过我，您经历的那场战役就是......","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":342},{"type":"multiline","name":"赞索斯","text":"那是米诺斯和萨尔贡签署正式停战协议前的最后一场仗，输了百年的米诺斯，","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#9$2","focus":"l","id":344},{"type":"multiline","name":"赞索斯","text":"哈，终于赢了。","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"那位同胞死命按着我的手，他的腿断了一条，拖住我的力气还是很大。","id":347},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#5$2","focus":"l","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我转过头，发现他满脸是泪，眼神中全是恐惧......不是对萨尔贡人的，而是对我的恐惧。","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我知道他在害怕什么。","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"他怕我毁了来之不易的“和平”；他怕我引发新的冲突，让残酷的战争延宕；他怕自己跟伊萨科斯一样，再也回不了家。","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我所有积压的怒火和悲痛无处发泄，只能死死盯着那个跪在地上的萨尔贡军官，而他正发愣地听着号角声，跟我一样表情麻木......","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"那一刻我就知道，战争会在我们的体内延续，它只会开始，从不结束。","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"......","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"老先生您说得对，我心中的米诺斯早就不在了，它在好几年前就随着那些“伊萨科斯”死在了战场上。","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#12$2","focus":"l","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"但我不能容许敌人再次践踏这片土地，哪怕这里是他们建造的城市。","id":361},{"type":"charslot","id":362},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"“他们建造的城市”......连我们的教科书上，也是这么写的？","id":364},{"type":"charslot","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#4$2","focus":"l","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"什么意思？","id":368},{"type":"charslot","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"伊萨科斯去过你的村庄，凭那小子热情得不像是我的种的天性，他一定教了你们很多建筑技术。","id":371},{"type":"charslot","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"是的，他几乎改建了村中每一处重要设施。","id":375},{"type":"charslot","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"他的手艺传自祖辈，在侵占时期，我的爷爷还曾因为工程技术过硬，被萨尔贡人强征去建移动城市。","id":378},{"type":"charslot","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"什么？","id":382},{"type":"charslot","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"这座雅赛努斯城的动力层，或许就有他的手笔吧。","id":385},{"type":"charslot","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"抱歉，刚刚我对您太失礼了，我......","id":389},{"type":"charslot","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"小子，别因为这点事就对人低头。","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"我又不是建造移动城市的工程师，况且没有任何东西能证明我们祖上曾为雅赛努斯的建设受过苦，所有的材料当时都被萨尔贡人收走了。","id":393},{"type":"charslot","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":395},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"萨尔贡人要米诺斯工程师的工作材料......为什么？","id":397},{"type":"charslot","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"工程师的手记，除了记录专业术语和图纸的修改方案之外，总会有些其他东西。","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"他当时需要核对建材的数量，统筹搬运和建筑小组，所以他很清楚人力排布，也记得每个工人的名字——","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"不是萨尔贡的工人，而是米诺斯劳工的名字，还有他们从哪里来，又是怎么被萨尔贡人强征来的信息。","id":402},{"type":"charslot","id":403},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":405},{"type":"multiline","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"米诺斯工人？我记得现在主流的观点是，在三城建设时期玛拉帕夏没有征用任何一名米诺斯工人进行重体力劳动，","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":407},{"type":"multiline","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"难道......","id":408},{"type":"charslot","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"历史不是由我们书写的，哪怕我们打赢了最后一场仗。","id":411},{"type":"charslot","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":413},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"可那些都是罪证，应该把它们公之于众，老先生您还记得那些工程师手记在哪里吗？","id":415},{"type":"charslot","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"这我哪清楚，你得问萨尔贡人......哦，不过当时的萨尔贡人现在应该也都死绝啦，哈哈......","id":418},{"type":"charslot","id":419},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#15$2","focus":"l","id":420},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"问萨尔贡人......三城建设时期......","id":422},{"type":"dialog","id":423},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":424},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"50","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":425},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"不对！","id":427},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"怎么了，老师？","id":429},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#12$2","focus":"l","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"萨尔贡使节想要用文物从我们这儿换走的根本不是技术资料，而是那些记载了萨尔贡人罪证的工程师手记！","id":431},{"type":"dialog","id":432},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":433},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":434},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":435},{"type":"image","id":436},{"type":"charslot","id":437}],"characters":["忧心的村民","赞索斯","游击队员A","游击队员B","游击队员C","游击队员D","萨尔贡军官","伊萨科斯父亲","吕刻伊昂"]}